  "content": "# 二段跳屬性\n二段跳屬性新增了一個讓玩家能在空中額外跳躍的新屬性。  \n此屬性可像其他屬性一樣應用，上限為1024次。  \n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/AmyMialeeMods/double-jump-attribute/raw/main/assets/jump.png\" alt=\"二段跳示意圖\">  \n\n若要將二段跳屬性添加為專案依賴，請在您的 `build.gradle` 中加入以下內容：\n```gradle\nrepositories {\n\tmaven { url = \"https://maven.willbl.dev/releases\" }\n}\n\ndependencies {\n\tmodImplementation \"amymialee:doublejumpattribute:1.0.7+1.19\"\n}\n```\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n    <tr>\n        <th><b>加入我的 Discord</b></th>\n        <th><b>在 Curseforge 上尋找此模組！</b></th>\n        <th><b>在 Modrinth 上尋找此模組！</b></th>\n        <th><b>在 Ko-fi 上支持我！</b></th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <th>\n            <a href=\"http://discord.amymialee.xyz\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/793182374410059887/924000460292104282/3437c10597c1526c3dbd98c737c2bcae.svg\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Discord\">\n            </a>\n        </th>\n        <th>\n            <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/double-jump-attribute\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/793182374410059887/923990008543711282/anvil.svg\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Curseforge\">\n            </a>\n        </th>\n        <th>\n            <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/double-jump-attribute\">\n                <img src=\"https://docs.modrinth.com/img/logo.svg\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n            </a>\n        </th>\n        <th>\n            <a href=\"http://kofi.amymialee.xyz\">\n                <img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi_stroke_cup.svg\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Ko-fi\">\n            </a>\n        </th>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<b>有興趣為我的任何模組架設伺服器嗎？</b>  \n請務必選擇 Bloom Host：  \n<a href=\"http://bloom.amymialee.xyz\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h4556XW.gif\">\n</a>  \n<b>使用此連結購買伺服器將直接支持我！</b>",
